                  // **********                Feature Engineering                 ***********

Defination: Feature Engineering is the process of Transforming raw data into useful features That helps a machine learing model learn better, It has 4 steps: 

-> Feature Transformation: Changing the form or scale of existing features to make them more suitable for the ML model, here we perfore things like 
            -> Missing Value Updation (Imputation)
            -> Handling Categorical Values using mechanisims like One-Hot-Codint ...etc
            -> Outliers Detection and Handling Them
            -> Feature Scaling 

-> Feature Construction: Creating new features from existing features to give the ML model more useful information.

-> Feature Selection: Choosing the most useful features from the available features and removing irrelevant or unnecessary ones.

-> Feature Extraction: Creating new, useful features from raw or complex data while reducing unnecessary information.
























